msgid "Navigation menu behavior"
msgstr "导航菜单行为"

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid ""
"Only the section of the current page is open, and opening a section closes "
"the others."
msgstr "仅展开当前页面所在的部分，展开其他部分时会关闭此前展开的部分。"

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Persistent"
msgstr "持久"

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid ""
"Sections stay open until you close them, from page to page, so several can "
"be open at once."
msgstr "各部分会保持展开状态，跳转页面时仍然保留，因此可同时展开多个部分。"

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Show breadcrumb"
msgstr "显示面包屑导航"

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid ""
"The section holding the current page is always open, whichever behavior is "
"chosen."
msgstr "无论选择哪种行为，包含当前页面的部分始终保持展开。"

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Use configuration default"
msgstr "使用配置默认值"

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Whether a filter input is displayed above the admin menu."
msgstr "控制管理菜单上方是否显示筛选输入框。"

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid ""
"Whether each list shows a selector with the available layouts. A user's "
"choice is kept in a cookie, per list, and applies to that user only. The "
"layout above stays the one every list starts from."
msgstr "控制每个列表是否显示可用布局的选择器。用户的选择按列表保存到 Cookie 中，仅适用于该用户。上方的布局仍是每个列表初始使用的布局。"

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Whether or not to display a theme toggler."
msgstr "控制是否显示主题切换器。"

#: Views/AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Whether the breadcrumb trail is displayed on admin screens."
msgstr "控制管理屏幕上是否显示面包屑导航。"

